---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../../site';

const repo = 'https://github.com/Geodude117/BattleShips';
---

<Base
  title="Salvo Sums"
  description="Salvo Sums is a Battleships-style iPhone and iPad game where every shot is earned by answering a GCSE maths question."
>
  <div class="app-head">
    <img src={url('images/salvo-sums/icon.png')} alt="Salvo Sums app icon" width="96" height="96" />
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">iPhone &amp; iPad app</p>
      <h1>Salvo Sums</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p class="lead">
      A Battleships-style game where every shot is earned by answering a GCSE maths question. Sink the computer's
      fleet before it sinks yours, and learn from a worked explanation whenever you get one wrong.
    </p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Place your fleet, then answer a multiple-choice question to load your guns.</li>
      <li>Foundation questions earn one shot, Higher questions earn two, and every third correct answer in a row earns a bonus shot.</li>
      <li>Five in a row unlocks a special weapon: an Airstrike or a Sonar scan.</li>
      <li>The computer has to "answer" too, so your accuracy decides the battle.</li>
      <li>Topics include fractions, percentages, ratio, linear equations, area, probability, expanding brackets and Pythagoras.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Salvo Sums doesn't collect any personal data. There are no accounts, ads or tracking, and it works fully offline.
      Read the <a href={url('salvo-sums/privacy/')}>privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 id="support">Support</h2>
    <p>
      Found a bug, spotted a maths mistake, or have an idea? Please
      <a href={`${repo}/issues/new`} rel="noopener" target="_blank">open an issue on GitHub</a>. Include your device,
      iOS version and, for a maths question, the question text so it can be checked and fixed.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .app-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .app-head img {
    border-radius: 22%;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }
  .app-head h1 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .app-head .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
</style>
